<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div><div><div><p><img alt="Cat" loading="lazy" width="224" height="224" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" srcset="https://docs.mistral.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fsprites%2Fcat_idle.gif&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, https://docs.mistral.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fsprites%2Fcat_idle.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="https://docs.mistral.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fsprites%2Fcat_idle.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"></p><div><p><span>October 6, 2026</span></p><p><span data-slot="badge" data-badge-type="yellow">Public Preview</span><span>v<!-- -->26.10</span></p></div><div data-slot="heading"><article><p>Mistral Large 4 is a state-of-the-art, open-weight, general-purpose multimodal model with a granular Mixture-of-Experts architecture. It features 49B active parameters and 1.05T total parameters, and a 1.6B vision encoder.</p></article></div></div><div><div><div><p><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><g fill="currentColor" clip-path="url(#_S_1_)"><path d="M16.086 3h-2.629v2.629h2.629v-2.63Z"></path><path d="M18.713 10.885h-5.257V5.628h-2.628v2.629H8.199v2.628H5.57v2.629h5.258v5.257H8.199V21.4h2.629V18.77h2.628v-2.628h2.629v-2.63h2.628v-2.628Z"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="_S_1_"><path fill="#fff" d="M5.571 3h13.143v18.4H5.571z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg>Speed</span></p></div><div><p><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><g fill="currentColor" clip-path="url(#_S_2_)"><path d="M16.8.5H7.2v3.286h9.6V.5ZM7.2 3.785H4v9.857h3.2V3.785ZM10.4 20.214V23.5h3.2v-3.286h3.2v-6.571H13.6v-3.286H10.4v3.286H7.2v6.571h3.2ZM20 3.785h-3.2v9.857H20V3.785Z"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="_S_2_"><path fill="#fff" d="M4 .5h16v23H4z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg>Performance</span></p></div><div><p><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" d="M18